            "notes": "Reports how much memory each virtual machine of a libvirt host has been given, how much of it the guest operating system actually needs, and how much of the host's memory the machine occupies. Alerts if a guest is running out of memory. Also reports how much of the host's memory is promised to the running machines, which is the number that says whether the host can still honour all of those promises. Runs without root or sudo.",
